<title>BOSNIA: Romanian in Bosnia peace force dies in road mishap.</title>
<headline>Romanian in Bosnia peace force dies in road mishap.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Romanian military engineer in the NATO-led peace force in Bosnia died when the road excavator he was driving tipped over and fell down a ravine, an alliance spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Major Brett Boudreau said the accident happened during road-building work near the eastern town of Gorazde on Tuesday. The Romanian's name was not released.</p>
</text>
